B.a4K=new A.oM("Ulysses has spent more than 19 years caring for dogs. He lives in an apartment, so he knows how to keep a dog happy, calm and well exercised without a big yard. Brio loves other dogs and is easy to be around, though like most Schipperkes he is a little protective and takes a moment to warm up to new people. That makes us patient with every shy or cautious pet that comes through our door.",null)
B.a4L=new A.oM("Brio is the name of our own Schipperke, a little black dog with a big personality. It also means energy and spirit, which is what we hope your pet brings home after a stay with us.",null)
B.a4M=new A.oM("Brio is a rescue, too. Giving a dog a second chance taught us how much a safe, loving home matters, and it is a big part of why we love caring for animals. Every pet who stays with us gets that same kind of care.",null)
B.a4N=new A.oM("We keep things small on purpose. When you book with Brio, you are booking with us, not a big company. We get to know you and your pet, and we treat your home and your animal the way we would want ours treated.",null)
B.a4O=new A.oM("Brio is a small pet-sitting service run by two people who genuinely love animals. Dogs, cats, and all pets are family to us, and we have years of hands-on experience caring for them.",null)
